- Apache HTTP Server 2.4 Limited OpenSSL Distribution
-
- This binary installation of OpenSSL is a limited distribution of the
- files derived from the OpenSSL project:
-
-   LICENSE.txt (includes openssl LICENSE)
-   OPENSSL-NEWS.txt
